mcp_items.description:
**FinancialData.Net MCP Server** 

A comprehensive MCP server delivering real-time and historical market data across stocks, ETFs, indices, forex, crypto, commodities, and derivatives. Beyond raw prices, it exposes tools for querying global financial statements, insider trading and ownership logs, institutional holdings, valuation and risk ratios, ESG metrics, and corporate actions. It also includes macroeconomic indicators and event calendars (economic releases, earnings, dividends, splits), enabling agents to run end-to-end workflows—from market screening to corporate and cross-asset analysis—backed by consistent, queryable datasets.

**Link**: 
https://financialdata.net/mcp-server

**Config**:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "financial-data": {
      "type": "remote",
      "url": "https://financialdata.net/mcp?key=API_KEY"
    }
  }
}
```
